# Context filter for `docker build -f cav21ae_dt/Dockerfile .`, read by BuildKit
# in preference to the repository's root `.dockerignore`, which it REPLACES
# rather than extends -- so this file repeats the root's entries and then adds
# back exactly what this artifact needs: its own directory, and the two
# files under `script/` its runner reads, which the root file excludes.  Without this the image is built
# without the experiment scripts the README tells the reader to run, and the
# build succeeds anyway, which is how the same mistake went unnoticed for a year
# in two other packages.  Requires BuildKit (the default since Docker 23.0).

.git
_build
.vscode

cav21ae_rel
popl24ae
icfp24ae
oopsla25ae
pldi26ae_lower
pldi26ae_omega
cav26ae
script/starexec
learner
script


# what this artifact runs (the root file excludes all of script/): run.sh calls
# run_corpus.sh, which reads the public table of runs
!script/run_corpus.sh
!script/bench_runs.txt
